When you open a image from a gallery, the top and bottom info/action bars take space, even in full screen, so the image is confined to the remaining space. It's a waste

**Describe the solution you'd like**
Make the bars float over the image and disappear if you move the mouse away from them, so you can see the image without distractions

**Describe alternatives you've considered**
